---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Work" description="Selected Blackline Development work and project capabilities.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h1>Show the work when there is something real to show.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          This portfolio will only publish projects, outcomes and client details that are approved for public use. No fabricated testimonials, vanity metrics or placeholder customer claims.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside">
        <strong>Portfolio foundation</strong>
        <p>The structure is ready for governed case studies, product screenshots and project stories as they are approved.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What will live here</p>
          <h2>Evidence over marketing filler.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each future case study should explain the problem, what was built, the important constraints and the outcome without exposing confidential customer information.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">01</span>
          <h3>Web</h3>
          <p>Public websites, service journeys and web platforms.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">02</span>
          <h3>Software</h3>
          <p>Purpose-built desktop and web applications.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">03</span>
          <h3>Automation</h3>
          <p>Bots, integrations and operational workflows.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">04</span>
          <h3>Managed delivery</h3>
          <p>Projects where Blackline continues to host, maintain or operate the supporting service.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
